s", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "The test `com.pholser.junit.quickcheck.UsualJUnitMachineryOnTraitBasedPropertyTest.expectedOrderingOfMethods` is system-dependent and fails when running on Mac. In addition, it's non-idempotent and fails if run twice in the same JVM, because it pollutes state shared among tests. It may be good to remove the system dependence so that it can be run consistently on every platform. Furthermore, the state pollution may be removed so that some other tests do not fail in the future due to the shared state polluted by these tests.\r\n\r\n## Details\r\nThe root cause is similar to what's detailed in https://github.com/pholser/junit-quickcheck/pull/286 .\r\n\r\nWith the suggested fixes, the test passes(on Mac), and does not pollute the shared state(also passes when run twice in the same JVM).", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2020-12-07T17:54:08Z", "updated_at": "2020-12-09T14:56:04Z", "closed_at": "2020-12-09T14:56:04Z", "merged_at": "2020-12-09T14:56:04Z", "merge_commit_sha": "bcd691eb3ab220fecdb5f3078b9fd9630ecdfbfc", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "lzx404243:zli89-fix-UsualJUnitMachineryOnTraitBasedPropertyTest", "ref": "zli89-fix-UsualJUnitMachineryOnTraitBasedPropertyTest", "repo": {"id": 319235421, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzMTkyMzU0MjE=", "name": "junit-quickcheck", "full_name": "lzx404243/junit-quickcheck", "owner": {"login": "lzx404243", "id": 19499960, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDk5OTYw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19499960?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243", "html_url": "https://github.com/lzx404243", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/lzx404243/gis